{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794528129732,"sessionID":"ses_e2dcb1a37ffeB0Y69siDRonAev","part":{"partID":"prt_1d23632ab001CXym1wKTAXzI7h","sessionID":"ses_e2dcb1a37ffeB0Y69siDRonAev","messageID":"msg_1d236211b001ok7p6xXQic08uH","type":"tool","id":"call_3cacfa94f15945a0b1f88eb3","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml"},"output":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml, lines 1-188\n1: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n2: # DOCTOR: RUNTIME MIRROR PARITY (READ-ONLY DIAGNOSTIC)\n3: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n4: role: Diagnostic Operator reporting whether every runtime config dir still mirrors its canonical source\n5: purpose: Detect drift across the agent, command, prompt and hook mirrors that .claude, .codex, .cursor, .devin, .pi and .dsh derive from .skilled, plus adapter-path resolution drift in the Claude, Codex, Cursor and Devin hook fallback chains\n6: action: Run every upstream-assets checker plus the hook-adapter fallback health checks -> aggregate their verdicts -> report per-surface drift\n7: skill_owner: \".skilled/skills/system-skilled-doctor/\"\n8: \n9: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n10: # OPERATING MODE\n11: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n12: operating_mode:\n13:   workflow: single-step\n14:   compliance: MANDATORY\n15:   execution: read_only\n16:   approvals: none\n17:   tracking: single_run\n18:   validation: read_only_assertion\n19: \n20: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n21: # MUTATION BOUNDARIES (READ-ONLY)\n22: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n23: mutation_boundaries:\n24:   read_only: true\n25:   allowed_targets: []\n26:   forbidden_targets:\n27:     - \"**/*\"\n28:   invariant: \"Every upstream_assets checker is invoked in its check-only form. This route MUST NOT run any generator in write mode, create or delete a symlink, or install a hook config. Repair is an explicit operator action, never a side effect of a diagnostic.\"\n29: \n30: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n31: # UPSTREAM ASSETS\n32: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n33: upstream_assets:\n34:   runtime_mirrors: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs\"\n35:   codex_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-agents.cjs\"\n36:   codex_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-prompts.cjs\"\n37:   agent_roster: \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agent-roster-mirror-check.cjs\"\n38:   agent_body_parity: \".skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs\"\n39:   command_catalog: \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/command-catalog-mirror-check.cjs\"\n40:   codex_hooks_installer: \".skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs\"\n41:   pi_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs\"\n42:   pi_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-prompts-pi.cjs\"\n43:   dsh_skills: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs\"\n44:   dsh_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs\"\n45:   dsh_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs\"\n46: \n47: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n48: # HOOK-ADAPTER FALLBACK HEALTH CHECKS\n49: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n50: # Every entry below is the primary adapter behind a `|| { <stderr>; <fallback JSON> }`\n51: # chain in .codex/hooks.json, .devin/hooks.v1.json, .claude/settings.json or\n52: # .cursor/hooks.json (the chains that carry the \"mkHookDrift\" marker). The one\n53: # exception is each fire-and-forget backgrounded reconcile command, which no\n54: # host reads stdout from and which deliberately runs without a fallback branch.\n55: # A missing path here is exactly the state a synthetic\n56: # adapter failure produces (e.g. temporarily renaming the compiled file), so a\n57: # `file_exists` failure on any row below is reported as a degraded hook adapter,\n58: # not a mirror-structure drift.\n59: hook_adapter_fallback_health_checks:\n60:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/dispatch/claude/dispatch-preflight-lint.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n61:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/spec-gate-enforce.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n62:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-preflight-advisory.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n63:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n64:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/task-dispatch/claude/task-dispatch-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n65:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/task-dispatch/claude/fable-subagent-guard.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n66:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/mcp-route-guard/claude/mcp-route-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n67:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/overlay-guard/claude/overlay-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n68:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/env-secret-guard/command-hook/env-secret-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n69:   - { host: claude, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/env-secret-guard/command-hook/env-secret-guard-after.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n70:   - { host: claude, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.js\", type: file_exists }\n71:   - { host: claude, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/spec-gate-classify.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n72:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/session-prime.js\", type: file_exists }\n73:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/worktree-guard.sh\", type: file_exists }\n74:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/check-git-hooks.sh\", type: file_exists }\n75:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/git-live-follow.sh\", type: file_exists }\n76:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/scripts/check-dist-staleness.sh\", type: file_exists }\n77:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n78:   - { host: claude, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/session-stop.js\", type: file_exists }\n79:   - { host: claude, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/completion-evidence-stop.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n80:   - { host: claude, event: SessionEnd, path: \".skilled/scripts/session-cleanup.sh\", type: file_exists }\n81:   - { host: claude, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/post-edit-quality/claude/claude-posttooluse.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n82:   - { host: claude, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/dispatch/claude/dispatch-audit-posttooluse.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n83:   - { host: claude, event: PreCompact, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/compact-inject.js\", type: file_exists }\n84:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/cursor/session-start.js\", type: file_exists }\n85:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/cursor/spec-gate-prebind.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n86:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/worktree-guard.sh\", type: file_exists }\n87:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/check-git-hooks.sh\", type: file_exists }\n88:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/scripts/check-dist-staleness.sh\", type: file_exists }\n89:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n90:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/hooks/goal/cursor/goal-inject.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n91:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionEnd, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/cursor/session-end.js\", type: file_exists }\n92:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionEnd, path: \".skilled/scripts/session-cleanup.sh\", type: file_exists }\n93:   - { host: cursor, event: preToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/cursor/spec-gate-enforce.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n94:   - { host: cursor, event: preToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/task-dispatch/cursor/task-dispatch-guard.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n95:   - { host: cursor, event: preToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-preflight-advisory.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n96:   - { host: cursor, event: preToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n97:   - { host: cursor, event: postToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/cursor/post-tool-use.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n98:   - { host: cursor, event: beforeSubmitPrompt, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/cursor/spec-gate-classify.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n99:   - { host: cursor, event: beforeSubmitPrompt, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/cursor/user-prompt-submit.js\", type: file_exists }\n100:   - { host: cursor, event: beforeMCPExecution, path: \".skilled/hooks/mcp-route-guard/cursor/mcp-route-guard.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n101:   - { host: cursor, event: preCompact, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/cursor/precompact.js\", type: file_exists }\n102:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/codex/session-start.js\", type: file_exists }\n103:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/worktree-guard.sh\", type: file_exists }\n104:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/check-git-hooks.sh\", type: file_exists }\n105:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/git-live-follow.sh\", type: file_exists }\n106:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/scripts/check-dist-staleness.sh\", type: file_exists }\n107:   - { host: codex, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/codex/user-prompt-submit.js\", type: file_exists }\n108:   - { host: codex, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/codex/spec-gate-classify.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n109:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/dispatch/codex/dispatch-preflight-lint.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n110:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-preflight-advisory.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n111:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n112:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/codex/spec-gate-enforce.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n113:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/mcp-route-guard/codex/mcp-route-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n114:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/overlay-guard/codex/overlay-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n115:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/env-secret-guard/command-hook/env-secret-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n116:   - { host: codex, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/env-secret-guard/command-hook/env-secret-guard-after.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n117:   - { host: codex, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/post-edit-quality/codex/post-edit-quality.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n118:   - { host: codex, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/dispatch/codex/dispatch-audit-posttooluse.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n119:   - { host: codex, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/codex/session-stop.js\", type: file_exists }\n120:   - { host: codex, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/codex/completion-evidence-stop.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n121:   - { host: codex, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/scripts/session-cleanup.sh\", type: file_exists }\n122:   - { host: codex, event: PreCompact, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/codex/compact-inject.js\", type: file_exists }\n123:   - { host: devin, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/devin/session-start.js\", type: file_exists }\n124:   - { host: devin, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/devin/user-prompt-submit.js\", type: file_exists }\n125:   - { host: devin, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-preflight-advisory.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n126:   - { host: devin, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n127:   - { host: devin, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/hooks/goal/devin/goal-inject.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n128:   - { host: devin, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/hooks/goal/devin/goal-inject.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n129:   - { host: devin, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/devin/session-stop.js\", type: file_exists }\n130: \n131: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n132: # INPUTS\n133: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n134: inputs:\n135:   none: \"This diagnostic takes no arguments. Every checker derives its expected state from the canonical trees and the runtimes' own config files.\"\n136: \n137: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n138: # EXECUTION\n139: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n140: execution:\n141:   steps:\n142:     - \"Run upstream_assets.runtime_mirrors with --check. Covers the cursor/devin agent, command and skill symlink trees, all four hook discovery mirrors and the .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/ links into the hook library. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n143:     - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_agents with --check. Covers the generated .codex/agents/*.toml. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n144:     - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_prompts with --check. Covers the generated .codex/prompts/*.md stubs. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n145:     - \"Run upstream_assets.agent_roster. Covers roster coverage across all five surfaces and rejects a real file where a symlink belongs. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift, 2 = checker error (bad argument, canonical dir missing, or crash).\"\n146:     - \"Run upstream_assets.agent_body_parity with --all. Compares each agent body across the runtime trees; same-file mirrors and non-comparable formats are reported, not counted as matches. Exit 0 = all comparable mirrors in sync, 1 = drift or comparison failure, 2 = checker invocation error (unknown option), 3 = not checkable (frontmatter parser unavailable).\"\n147:     - \"Run upstream_assets.command_catalog. Compare command frontmatter with the root and family indexes and hub metadata. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift, 2 = checker error.\"\n148:     - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_hooks_installer with --check --allow-worktree. Covers the user-global ~/.codex/hooks.json against the repo's .codex/hooks.json, including orphaned entries whose .skilled adapter no longer exists on disk. Explicit OK output = in sync; a drift report = drift; refusal, error, or missing affirmative output = error.\"\n149:     - \"Run upstream_assets.pi_agents with --check. Covers the generated .pi/agents/*.md. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n150:     - \"Run upstream_assets.pi_prompts with --check. Covers the generated .pi/prompts/*.md stubs. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n151:     - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_skills, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/skills/ links. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n152:     - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_prompts, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/prompts/*.md files. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n153:     - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_agents, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/agents/*.patch.yml files. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n154:     - \"For each row in hook_adapter_fallback_health_checks, run its file_exists check (a plain path-existence read, no execution of the adapter or the shell command that wraps it). Collect every row whose path does not resolve as a degraded hook adapter, keyed by host:event:path.\"\n155:     - \"Aggregate: report each surface with its own verdict rather than a single pass/fail, so the operator learns which mirror moved.\"\n156: \n157: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n158: # OUTPUT\n159: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n160: output: |\n161:   STATUS=OK when every checker reports in sync, or n/a for a DSH row while its runtime tree is absent.\n162:   STATUS=DRIFT when any checker reports drift, listing each drifting surface and the repair command for it:\n163:     runtime mirrors  -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs\n164:     codex agents     -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-agents.cjs\n165:     codex prompts    -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-prompts.cjs\n166:     codex hooks      -> node .skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs\n167:     agent body parity (.skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs) -> .claude/agents is a hand-maintained real-file mirror; update both its .skilled source and Claude twin, then run node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-agents.cjs for .codex/agents, node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs for .pi/agents, and node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs for the .cursor and .devin links\n168:     pi agents        -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs\n169:     pi prompts       -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-prompts-pi.cjs\n170:     dsh skills       -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs\n171:     dsh prompts      -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs\n172:     dsh agents       -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs\n173:     command catalog  -> update the root and family indexes, group counts, and hub metadata from command frontmatter\n174:   While .dsh/ is absent the three DSH rows read n/a (no .dsh/ tree), never in sync, and leave\n175:   STATUS unchanged: the mirror does not exist yet, and this run never creates it. Their repair lines are the generators without --check, run once the tree exists.\n176:   The agent roster check has no generator. Its drift is repaired by the runtime-mirrors generator or by hand\n177:   for the authored surfaces (.skilled/agents and .claude/agents).\n178:   Hook CONFIG STRUCTURE is deliberately out of scope for mirroring: the four runtimes use incompatible event\n179:   vocabularies and entry shapes, so those files are hand-authored per runtime and cannot be mirror-checked\n180:   against each other.\n181:   Separately, \"N hook adapters degraded to fallback\" reports the count of hook_adapter_fallback_health_checks\n182:   rows whose path does not resolve, each listed as host:event:path. This is the same drift a live adapter\n183:   failure produces (its fallback JSON would carry \"mkHookDrift\": true and its stderr a matching\n184:   \"mk-hook-drift host=<host> event=<event> adapter=<name>\" line) surfaced without needing to fire the hook or\n185:   read raw JSON. Repair is adapter-specific: rebuild the runtime (npm --prefix\n186:   .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime run build) for a dist/hooks/* path, or restore/recreate the named\n187:   script for a .skilled/bin or .skilled/hooks path.\n188:   STATUS=ERROR when a checker refuses to run, returns an error, or omits an affirmative result.","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml, lines 1-188\n1: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n2: # DOCTOR: RUNTIME MIRROR PARITY (READ-ONLY DIAGNOSTIC)\n3: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n4: role: Diagnostic Operator reporting whether every runtime config dir still mirrors its canonical source\n5: purpose: Detect drift across the agent, command, prompt and hook mirrors that .claude, .codex, .cursor, .devin, .pi and .dsh derive from .skilled, plus adapter-path resolution drift in the Claude, Codex, Cursor and Devin hook fallback chains\n6: action: Run every upstream-assets checker plus the hook-adapter fallback health checks -> aggregate their verdicts -> report per-surface drift\n7: skill_owner: \".skilled/skills/system-skilled-doctor/\"\n8: \n9: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n10: # OPERATING MODE\n11: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n12: operating_mode:\n13:   workflow: single-step\n14:   compliance: MANDATORY\n15:   execution: read_only\n16:   approvals: none\n17:   tracking: single_run\n18:   validation: read_only_assertion\n19: \n20: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n21: # MUTATION BOUNDARIES (READ-ONLY)\n22: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n23: mutation_boundaries:\n24:   read_only: true\n25:   allowed_targets: []\n26:   forbidden_targets:\n27:     - \"**/*\"\n28:   invariant: \"Every upstream_assets checker is invoked in its check-only form. This route MUST NOT run any generator in write mode, create or delete a symlink, or install a hook config. Repair is an explicit operator action, never a side effect of a diagnostic.\"\n29: \n30: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n31: # UPSTREAM ASSETS\n32: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n33: upstream_assets:\n34:   runtime_mirrors: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs\"\n35:   codex_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-agents.cjs\"\n36:   codex_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-prompts.cjs\"\n37:   agent_roster: \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agent-roster-mirror-check.cjs\"\n38:   agent_body_parity: \".skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs\"\n39:   command_catalog: \".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/command-catalog-mirror-check.cjs\"\n40:   codex_hooks_installer: \".skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs\"\n41:   pi_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs\"\n42:   pi_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-prompts-pi.cjs\"\n43:   dsh_skills: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs\"\n44:   dsh_prompts: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs\"\n45:   dsh_agents: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs\"\n46: \n47: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n48: # HOOK-ADAPTER FALLBACK HEALTH CHECKS\n49: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n50: # Every entry below is the primary adapter behind a `|| { <stderr>; <fallback JSON> }`\n51: # chain in .codex/hooks.json, .devin/hooks.v1.json, .claude/settings.json or\n52: # .cursor/hooks.json (the chains that carry the \"mkHookDrift\" marker). The one\n53: # exception is each fire-and-forget backgrounded reconcile command, which no\n54: # host reads stdout from and which deliberately runs without a fallback branch.\n55: # A missing path here is exactly the state a synthetic\n56: # adapter failure produces (e.g. temporarily renaming the compiled file), so a\n57: # `file_exists` failure on any row below is reported as a degraded hook adapter,\n58: # not a mirror-structure drift.\n59: hook_adapter_fallback_health_checks:\n60:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/dispatch/claude/dispatch-preflight-lint.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n61:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/spec-gate-enforce.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n62:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-preflight-advisory.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n63:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n64:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/task-dispatch/claude/task-dispatch-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n65:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/task-dispatch/claude/fable-subagent-guard.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n66:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/mcp-route-guard/claude/mcp-route-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n67:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/overlay-guard/claude/overlay-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n68:   - { host: claude, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/env-secret-guard/command-hook/env-secret-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n69:   - { host: claude, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/env-secret-guard/command-hook/env-secret-guard-after.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n70:   - { host: claude, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/user-prompt-submit.js\", type: file_exists }\n71:   - { host: claude, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/spec-gate-classify.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n72:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/session-prime.js\", type: file_exists }\n73:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/worktree-guard.sh\", type: file_exists }\n74:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/check-git-hooks.sh\", type: file_exists }\n75:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/git-live-follow.sh\", type: file_exists }\n76:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/scripts/check-dist-staleness.sh\", type: file_exists }\n77:   - { host: claude, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n78:   - { host: claude, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/session-stop.js\", type: file_exists }\n79:   - { host: claude, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/claude/completion-evidence-stop.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n80:   - { host: claude, event: SessionEnd, path: \".skilled/scripts/session-cleanup.sh\", type: file_exists }\n81:   - { host: claude, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/post-edit-quality/claude/claude-posttooluse.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n82:   - { host: claude, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/dispatch/claude/dispatch-audit-posttooluse.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n83:   - { host: claude, event: PreCompact, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/claude/compact-inject.js\", type: file_exists }\n84:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/cursor/session-start.js\", type: file_exists }\n85:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/cursor/spec-gate-prebind.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n86:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/worktree-guard.sh\", type: file_exists }\n87:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/check-git-hooks.sh\", type: file_exists }\n88:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/scripts/check-dist-staleness.sh\", type: file_exists }\n89:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n90:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionStart, path: \".skilled/hooks/goal/cursor/goal-inject.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n91:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionEnd, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/cursor/session-end.js\", type: file_exists }\n92:   - { host: cursor, event: sessionEnd, path: \".skilled/scripts/session-cleanup.sh\", type: file_exists }\n93:   - { host: cursor, event: preToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/cursor/spec-gate-enforce.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n94:   - { host: cursor, event: preToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/task-dispatch/cursor/task-dispatch-guard.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n95:   - { host: cursor, event: preToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-preflight-advisory.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n96:   - { host: cursor, event: preToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n97:   - { host: cursor, event: postToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/cursor/post-tool-use.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n98:   - { host: cursor, event: beforeSubmitPrompt, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/cursor/spec-gate-classify.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n99:   - { host: cursor, event: beforeSubmitPrompt, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/cursor/user-prompt-submit.js\", type: file_exists }\n100:   - { host: cursor, event: beforeMCPExecution, path: \".skilled/hooks/mcp-route-guard/cursor/mcp-route-guard.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n101:   - { host: cursor, event: preCompact, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/cursor/precompact.js\", type: file_exists }\n102:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/codex/session-start.js\", type: file_exists }\n103:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/worktree-guard.sh\", type: file_exists }\n104:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/check-git-hooks.sh\", type: file_exists }\n105:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/bin/git-live-follow.sh\", type: file_exists }\n106:   - { host: codex, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/scripts/check-dist-staleness.sh\", type: file_exists }\n107:   - { host: codex, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/codex/user-prompt-submit.js\", type: file_exists }\n108:   - { host: codex, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/codex/spec-gate-classify.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n109:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/dispatch/codex/dispatch-preflight-lint.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n110:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-preflight-advisory.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n111:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n112:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/codex/spec-gate-enforce.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n113:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/mcp-route-guard/codex/mcp-route-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n114:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/overlay-guard/codex/overlay-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n115:   - { host: codex, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/env-secret-guard/command-hook/env-secret-guard.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n116:   - { host: codex, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/env-secret-guard/command-hook/env-secret-guard-after.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n117:   - { host: codex, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/post-edit-quality/codex/post-edit-quality.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n118:   - { host: codex, event: PostToolUse, path: \".skilled/hooks/dispatch/codex/dispatch-audit-posttooluse.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n119:   - { host: codex, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/codex/session-stop.js\", type: file_exists }\n120:   - { host: codex, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/hooks/codex/completion-evidence-stop.cjs\", type: file_exists }\n121:   - { host: codex, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/scripts/session-cleanup.sh\", type: file_exists }\n122:   - { host: codex, event: PreCompact, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/codex/compact-inject.js\", type: file_exists }\n123:   - { host: devin, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/devin/session-start.js\", type: file_exists }\n124:   - { host: devin, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/devin/user-prompt-submit.js\", type: file_exists }\n125:   - { host: devin, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-preflight-advisory.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n126:   - { host: devin, event: PreToolUse, path: \".skilled/skills/sk-git/scripts/hooks/git-message-gate.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n127:   - { host: devin, event: SessionStart, path: \".skilled/hooks/goal/devin/goal-inject.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n128:   - { host: devin, event: UserPromptSubmit, path: \".skilled/hooks/goal/devin/goal-inject.mjs\", type: file_exists }\n129:   - { host: devin, event: Stop, path: \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/dist/hooks/devin/session-stop.js\", type: file_exists }\n130: \n131: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n132: # INPUTS\n133: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n134: inputs:\n135:   none: \"This diagnostic takes no arguments. Every checker derives its expected state from the canonical trees and the runtimes' own config files.\"\n136: \n137: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n138: # EXECUTION\n139: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n140: execution:\n141:   steps:\n142:     - \"Run upstream_assets.runtime_mirrors with --check. Covers the cursor/devin agent, command and skill symlink trees, all four hook discovery mirrors and the .dsh/plugins/repo-guards/adapters/ links into the hook library. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n143:     - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_agents with --check. Covers the generated .codex/agents/*.toml. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n144:     - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_prompts with --check. Covers the generated .codex/prompts/*.md stubs. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n145:     - \"Run upstream_assets.agent_roster. Covers roster coverage across all five surfaces and rejects a real file where a symlink belongs. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift, 2 = checker error (bad argument, canonical dir missing, or crash).\"\n146:     - \"Run upstream_assets.agent_body_parity with --all. Compares each agent body across the runtime trees; same-file mirrors and non-comparable formats are reported, not counted as matches. Exit 0 = all comparable mirrors in sync, 1 = drift or comparison failure, 2 = checker invocation error (unknown option), 3 = not checkable (frontmatter parser unavailable).\"\n147:     - \"Run upstream_assets.command_catalog. Compare command frontmatter with the root and family indexes and hub metadata. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift, 2 = checker error.\"\n148:     - \"Run upstream_assets.codex_hooks_installer with --check --allow-worktree. Covers the user-global ~/.codex/hooks.json against the repo's .codex/hooks.json, including orphaned entries whose .skilled adapter no longer exists on disk. Explicit OK output = in sync; a drift report = drift; refusal, error, or missing affirmative output = error.\"\n149:     - \"Run upstream_assets.pi_agents with --check. Covers the generated .pi/agents/*.md. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n150:     - \"Run upstream_assets.pi_prompts with --check. Covers the generated .pi/prompts/*.md stubs. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n151:     - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_skills, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/skills/ links. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n152:     - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_prompts, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/prompts/*.md files. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n153:     - \"Run upstream_assets.dsh_agents, the command node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs --check. Covers the generated .dsh/agents/*.patch.yml files. When .dsh/ is absent, report the row as n/a (no .dsh/ tree) without running the check; an n/a row leaves STATUS unchanged, and this run never creates that directory. Exit 0 = in sync, 1 = drift.\"\n154:     - \"For each row in hook_adapter_fallback_health_checks, run its file_exists check (a plain path-existence read, no execution of the adapter or the shell command that wraps it). Collect every row whose path does not resolve as a degraded hook adapter, keyed by host:event:path.\"\n155:     - \"Aggregate: report each surface with its own verdict rather than a single pass/fail, so the operator learns which mirror moved.\"\n156: \n157: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n158: # OUTPUT\n159: # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n160: output: |\n161:   STATUS=OK when every checker reports in sync, or n/a for a DSH row while its runtime tree is absent.\n162:   STATUS=DRIFT when any checker reports drift, listing each drifting surface and the repair command for it:\n163:     runtime mirrors  -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs\n164:     codex agents     -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-agents.cjs\n165:     codex prompts    -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-prompts.cjs\n166:     codex hooks      -> node .skilled/bin/install-codex-hooks.mjs\n167:     agent body parity (.skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs) -> .claude/agents is a hand-maintained real-file mirror; update both its .skilled source and Claude twin, then run node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/codex/sync-agents.cjs for .codex/agents, node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs for .pi/agents, and node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-runtime-mirrors.cjs for the .cursor and .devin links\n168:     pi agents        -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-agents-pi.cjs\n169:     pi prompts       -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/pi/sync-prompts-pi.cjs\n170:     dsh skills       -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-skills-dsh.cjs\n171:     dsh prompts      -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-prompts-dsh.cjs\n172:     dsh agents       -> node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dsh/sync-agents-dsh.cjs\n173:     command catalog  -> update the root and family indexes, group counts, and hub metadata from command frontmatter\n174:   While .dsh/ is absent the three DSH rows read n/a (no .dsh/ tree), never in sync, and leave\n175:   STATUS unchanged: the mirror does not exist yet, and this run never creates it. Their repair lines are the generators without --check, run once the tree exists.\n176:   The agent roster check has no generator. Its drift is repaired by the runtime-mirrors generator or by hand\n177:   for the authored surfaces (.skilled/agents and .claude/agents).\n178:   Hook CONFIG STRUCTURE is deliberately out of scope for mirroring: the four runtimes use incompatible event\n179:   vocabularies and entry shapes, so those files are hand-authored per runtime and cannot be mirror-checked\n180:   against each other.\n181:   Separately, \"N hook adapters degraded to fallback\" reports the count of hook_adapter_fallback_health_checks\n182:   rows whose path does not resolve, each listed as host:event:path. This is the same drift a live adapter\n183:   failure produces (its fallback JSON would carry \"mkHookDrift\": true and its stderr a matching\n184:   \"mk-hook-drift host=<host> event=<event> adapter=<name>\" line) surfaced without needing to fire the hook or\n185:   read raw JSON. Repair is adapter-specific: rebuild the runtime (npm --prefix\n186:   .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime run build) for a dist/hooks/* path, or restore/recreate the named\n187:   script for a .skilled/bin or .skilled/hooks path.\n188:   STATUS=ERROR when a checker refuses to run, returns an error, or omits an affirmative result."}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-runtime-mirrors.yaml\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528129707,"end":1794528129732}}}}
