nk, and it never writes a link, directory, ignore line or run record. Findings describe the target repository and do not change its state. The route also runs the read-only hook-wiring check, which reads each installed runtime's prompt hook entry and never writes.\"\n \n # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n # UPSTREAM ASSETS\n # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-symlink-check.yaml (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-symlink-check.yaml\",\"oldString\":\"  invariant: \\\"This route runs the check subcommand only. It never runs plan, apply or unlink, and it never writes a link, directory, ignore line or run record. Findings describe the target repository and do not change its state.\\\"\",\"newString\":\"  invariant: \\\"This route runs the check subcommand only. It never runs plan, apply or unlink, and it never writes a link, directory, ignore line or run record. Findings describe the target repository and do not change its state. The route also runs the read-only hook-wiring check, which reads each installed runtime's prompt hook entry and never writes.\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794528280074,"end":1794528281529}}}}
